<translate>
==== AimingTimeModifier ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Modifier for the time it takes to aim (WeaponPart item). A positive number to speed up aiming speed.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
AimingTimeModifier = 5,
</syntaxhighlight>
